<title>USA: Pairgain sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Pairgain sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PairGain Technologies Inc said it plans a 2-for-1 stock split.</p>
<p>It said the record date for the dividend was December 11, but it did was not immediately available to disclose the pay date.</p>
</text>
